# Cloudflare Pages Canonical Routing & SPA Fallbacks
# Format: <source> <destination> <status_code>

# 1. Canonical Redirects & Clean Normalization
/home / 301
/feed /feed.xml 301
/rss /rss.xml 301
/atom /atom.xml 301
/sitemap /sitemap.xml 301

# 2. Canonical Category Aliases (Logical hierarchy)
/category/architecture /categories/architecture-and-space 301
/category/art /categories/art-and-culture 301
/category/design /categories/design-and-typography 301
/category/tech /categories/engineering-and-technology 301
/category/* /categories/:splat 301

# 3. Cloudflare Pages SPA Fallback for Dynamic Routes (e.g. secondary market assets)
# Static prerendered HTML pages are served directly by Cloudflare Pages;
# Non-prerendered dynamic routes fallback to /index.html for client hydration.
/* /index.html 200
